            {"type": "mcq", "q": "Changing the viewing angle of a reconstructed hologram reveals different perspectives of the object, a property known as ____.", "options": ["parallax", "birefringence", "dichroism", "rectilinear propagation"], "answer": 0, "time": 45, "practice": "remember-word", "why": "Because the full 3D wavefront is reconstructed, the viewer observes natural parallax."}
