            {"type": "question", "label": "PYQ · 5 marks", "title": "Question 19", "marks": 5, "q": "Calculate the numerical aperture and hence the acceptance angle of an optical fiber having core and cladding refractive indices 1.45 and 1.40 respectively."},
            {"type": "eval", "q": "Calculation of NA and acceptance angle theta_a", "options": [{"t": "NA = 0.3775 and acceptance angle theta_a = 22.18 degrees calculated", "m": 5}, {"t": "Only NA = 0.3775 calculated without acceptance angle", "m": 3}, {"t": "Formulas only", "m": 1.5}, {"t": "Missing or wrong", "m": 0}], "why": "Compute NA = sqrt(1.45^2 - 1.40^2) and take sin^-1(NA) to get theta_a."},
