            {"type": "mcq", "q": "The determinant of a translation matrix \\( \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ d/n & 1 \\end{bmatrix} \\) is always ____.", "options": ["1", "d over n", "0", "n"], "answer": 0, "time": 45, "practice": "remember-word", "why": "1*1 - 0*(d/n) = 1."}
