            {"type": "mcq", "q": "In the system matrix \\( S = \\begin{bmatrix} b & -a \\\\ -d & c \\end{bmatrix} \\), the element \\( a \\) is the ____.", "options": ["equivalent optical power 1/f", "lateral magnification", "distance between lenses", "aperture diameter"], "answer": 0, "time": 45, "practice": "remember-word", "why": "A parallel incident ray (lambda1 = 0) emerges with slope lambda2 = -a y1 = -(1/f) y1."}
