            {"type": "mcq", "q": "For a fiber immersed in a medium of refractive index \\( n_0 \\), the numerical aperture is \\( \\sqrt{n_1^2 - n_2^2} \\) divided by ____.", "options": ["n0", "n1", "n2", "2 pi"], "answer": 0, "time": 45, "practice": "remember-word", "why": "From n0 sin(theta_a) = sqrt(n1^2 - n2^2), sin(theta_a) = sqrt(n1^2 - n2^2) / n0."},
