            {"type": "question", "label": "PYQ · 4 marks", "title": "Question 26", "marks": 4, "q": "In the Newton rings arrangement, the radius of curvature of the curved side of the planoconvex lens is 100cm. For \\lambda = 6 \\times 10^{-5}cm, what will be the radii of the 9th and 10th bright rings?"},
