            {"type": "question", "label": "PYQ · 10 marks", "title": "Question 33", "marks": 10, "q": "Discuss Fraunhofer type of diffraction produced by a narrow slit illuminated by monochromatic light. Obtain the positions of the maxima and minima and draw a diagram to indicate the distribution intensity of light in the diffraction pattern."},
