              "title": "Single-slit Fraunhofer diffraction intensity and extrema",
              "legend": "Slit AB of width b diffracting parallel rays at angle theta through lens L to screen point P, with sinc^2 intensity curve.",
              "setup": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 180\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#d93025\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#d93025\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#d93025\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"50\" fill=\"#e8f0fe\" stroke=\"#1a73e8\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#188038\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#188038\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"195\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 195 30 Q 202 35 195 40 Q 212 48 195 58 Q 255 90 195 122 Q 212 132 195 142 Q 202 145 195 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d93025\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"9\">A</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"9\">B</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"9\">b</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"9\">θ</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"9\">I0</text></svg>",
              "phases": ["Wavelet integration", "Intensity law", "Minima condition", "Secondary maxima"],
              "steps": [
                {"phase": 0, "math": "E = \\frac{A_0}{b}\\int_{-b/2}^{b/2}\\cos\\left(\\omega t - \\frac{2\\pi}{\n\\lambda}x\\sin\\theta\\right)dx = A_0\\frac{\\sin\\beta}{\\beta}\\cos\\omega t", "note": "Integrate secondary wavelets across the slit width b with half-phase beta = pi b sin(theta) / lambda."},
                {"phase": 1, "math": "I = I_0\\left(\\frac{\\sin\\beta}{\\beta}\\right)^2, \\quad I(\\beta\\to 0) = I_0", "note": "Square the amplitude to obtain the intensity distribution and evaluate the central maximum at beta = 0."},
                {"phase": 2, "math": "\\sin\\beta = 0 \\;(\\beta \\neq 0) \\implies \\beta = \\pm m\\pi \\implies b\\sin\\theta = \\pm m\\lambda", "note": "Find the directions of zero intensity (dark fringes) for integer m = 1, 2, 3, ..."},
                {"phase": 3, "math": "\\frac{dI}{d\\beta} = 0 \\implies \\tan\\beta = \\beta \\implies \\beta \\approx \\pm(2m+1)\\frac{\\pi}{2}", "note": "Differentiate I with respect to beta to locate the secondary maxima between consecutive minima."}
