            {"type": "mcq", "q": "In a parabolic-index medium, all paraxial rays launched from a point on the axis periodically focus and take the ____.", "options": ["same transit time", "infinite transit time", "zero transit time", "negative transit time"], "answer": 0, "time": 45, "practice": "remember-word", "why": "Fermat's principle guarantees equal transit times between periodic foci."}
