            {"type": "mcq", "q": "When a calcite crystal is rotated about the normal to a printed page, the image that rotates around the stationary image is the ____.", "options": ["extraordinary image", "ordinary image", "virtual source", "Airy disc"], "answer": 0, "time": 45, "practice": "remember-word", "why": "As shown in Fig. 22.20(b) of Ghatak, the e-ray lies in the rotating principal section."},
