            {"type": "eval", "q": "Statement of Fermat's principle and deduction of laws of reflection (i = r)", "options": [{"t": "Fermat's extremum principle stated and law of reflection i = r derived via geometric image A' or dL/dx = 0", "m": 2}, {"t": "Only statement without reflection proof", "m": 1}, {"t": "Missing or wrong", "m": 0}], "why": "State Fermat's principle and minimize AP + PB to obtain i = r."},
